  "description": "Monstera is a twin-tower play station whose frames copy the curved, split leaves of the monstera plant. The cut-outs let light and sight lines through, so parents can watch children on the upper levels. From above, four Lemon Yellow slides spread out in an X, one from each corner of the towers. Four slides let a large group come down at once, which is useful in a school or a big society park. It suits ages 5 to 12 and holds up to 15 children. The product area is 24' x 20'4\" and the safe play area is 30' x 26'4\". Climbing and sliding here build body strength and imagination. The 3-year warranty applies to galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Ask us for a quote.",
